          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "t'iketho cingin i wic mere. Ilathumo ruwaŋ Wema ma romo, aka wot Aron jolakiro remo mere thoko migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilamiyo paka mic perin wok kwoŋe, paka mic ri Rwoth, bor ma umo gigipiny ma iye je, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "roge ario gi bor ma umo kowino, kodi adec maber loyo ma cuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lawaŋo i wi migam paka mic ma cemo manyinge m'owaŋ gi mac maŋwe kur mamit ri Rwoth. Bor je obedo apa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me obedo cik ma cil gi cil i luse mewin je, kama winobed'iye je; wikiripi camo bor je kodi remo je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
